#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implementing a Controller"
msgstr "OpenEMS-Entwicklung: Eigene Komponente oder Controller"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"xref:edge/implement.adoc[Implementing a Device] is a step-by-step tutorial "
"for a device. This page complements it with the parts of an OpenEMS "
"Component and uses a Controller as a template: **Balancing** (self-"
"consumption optimization, bundle "
"`+io.openems.edge.controller.ess.balancing+`), which is small, complete and "
"has a test. For charge points, `+CLAUDE.md+` names the bundles "
"`+io.openems.edge.evse.chargepoint.keba+` and `+…mennekes+` as templates; "
"for Modbus devices see xref:development/implementing/modbus-device-"
"drivers.adoc[Modbus device drivers]."
msgstr ""
"xref:latest@edge/implement.adoc[Implementing a Device] ist eine Schritt-für-"
"Schritt-Anleitung für ein Gerät. Diese Seite ergänzt sie um die Teile einer "
"Komponente. Als Vorlage dient der Controller **Balancing** "
"(Eigenverbrauchsoptimierung, Bundle "
"`+io.openems.edge.controller.ess.balancing+`): klein, vollständig und mit "
"Test. Für Ladepunkte nennt `+CLAUDE.md+` die Bundles "
"`+io.openems.edge.evse.chargepoint.keba+` und `+…mennekes+` als Vorlagen, "
"für Modbus-Geräte siehe xref:development/implementing/modbus-device-"
"drivers.adoc[Modbus-Gerätetreiber]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Files of a bundle"
msgstr "Dateien eines Bundles"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"io.openems.edge.controller.ess.balancing/\n"
"  bnd.bnd                         bundle name, -buildpath, -testpath\n"
"  readme.adoc                     description for the documentation\n"
"  src/io/openems/edge/controller/ess/balancing/\n"
"    Config.java                   configuration fields\n"
"    ControllerEssBalancing.java   interface with its own Channels\n"
"    ControllerEssBalancingImpl.java  implementation\n"
"  test/io/openems/edge/controller/ess/balancing/\n"
"    MyConfig.java                 builder for the configuration in the test\n"
"    BalancingImplTest.java        test\n"
msgstr ""
"io.openems.edge.controller.ess.balancing/\n"
"  bnd.bnd                         Bundle-Name, -buildpath, -testpath\n"
"  readme.adoc                     Beschreibung für die Dokumentation\n"
"  src/io/openems/edge/controller/ess/balancing/\n"
"    Config.java                   Konfigurationsfelder\n"
"    ControllerEssBalancing.java   Interface mit eigenen Channels\n"
"    ControllerEssBalancingImpl.java  Implementierung\n"
"  test/io/openems/edge/controller/ess/balancing/\n"
"    MyConfig.java                 Builder für die Konfiguration im Test\n"
"    BalancingImplTest.java        Test\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"In `+bnd.bnd+`, `+-buildpath+` lists all required OpenEMS bundles in "
"addition to `+${buildpath}+`, here `+io.openems.common+`, "
"`+io.openems.edge.common+`, `+io.openems.edge.controller.api+`, "
"`+io.openems.edge.ess.api+`, `+io.openems.edge.meter.api+`. `+${buildpath}+` "
"and `+${testpath}+` are defined in `+cnf/build.bnd+` (Gson, Guava, OSGi "
"annotations, logging, JUnit)."
msgstr ""
"In `+bnd.bnd+` stehen unter `+-buildpath+` neben `+${buildpath}+` alle "
"benötigten OpenEMS-Bundles, hier `+io.openems.common+`, "
"`+io.openems.edge.common+`, `+io.openems.edge.controller.api+`, "
"`+io.openems.edge.ess.api+`, `+io.openems.edge.meter.api+`. `+${buildpath}+` "
"und `+${testpath}+` sind in `+cnf/build.bnd+` definiert (Gson, Guava, OSGi-"
"Annotationen, Logging, JUnit)."

