#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "What the parts do"
msgstr "Was die Teile bewirken"

#. type: #sec-what-the-parts-do
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**`+configurationPolicy = REQUIRE+`**: the component is only created if a "
"configuration exists."
msgstr ""
"**`+configurationPolicy = REQUIRE+`**: Die Komponente entsteht nur, wenn "
"eine Konfiguration existiert."

#. type: #sec-what-the-parts-do
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**Constructor**: pass all `+ChannelId+` enums of the implemented Natures. If "
"one is missing, its Channels do not exist and access fails at runtime."
msgstr ""
"**Konstruktor**: Alle `+ChannelId+`-Enums der implementierten Natures "
"übergeben. Fehlt eines, existieren dessen Channels nicht und der Zugriff "
"scheitert zur Laufzeit."

#. type: #sec-what-the-parts-do
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**`+implements+`**: list all Natures, including parent interfaces (see "
"xref:development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc[Components and "
"Channels in code])."
msgstr ""
"**`+implements+`**: alle Natures aufzählen, auch Eltern-Interfaces (siehe "
"xref:development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc[Architektur])."

#. type: #sec-what-the-parts-do
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**`+getOrError()+`**: throws an exception if the value is missing (e.g. "
"meter not reachable). The Scheduler catches it and sets `+RunFailed+`. If "
"you want to handle missing values differently, use `+get()+` (can be "
"`+null+`) or `+orElse(…)+`."
msgstr ""
"**`+getOrError()+`**: wirft eine Ausnahme, wenn der Wert fehlt (z. B. Zähler "
"nicht erreichbar). Der Scheduler fängt sie ab und setzt `+RunFailed+`. Wer "
"mit fehlenden Werten anders umgehen will, nutzt `+get()+` (kann `+null+` "
"sein) oder `+orElse(…)+`."

#. type: #sec-what-the-parts-do
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**Setpoints** to ESS go through ESS Power; details under xref:development/"
"fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc[Cycle]."
msgstr ""
"**Sollwerte** an Speicher gehen über die Leistungsverteilung; Einzelheiten "
"unter xref:development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc[Zyklus]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "References to other components"
msgstr "Referenzen auf andere Komponenten"

#. type: #sec-references-to-other-components
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"A Controller receives meters and ESS via OSGi `+@Reference+`. Which Instance "
"is meant is specified in the configuration (`+ess_id+`). For OSGi to inject "
"the correct Instance, the reference needs a **target filter** with this ID."
msgstr ""
"Ein Controller bekommt Zähler und Speicher über OSGi-`+@Reference+`. Welche "
"Instanz gemeint ist, steht in der Konfiguration (`+ess_id+`). Damit OSGi die "
"richtige Instanz injiziert, braucht die Referenz einen **Target-Filter** mit "
"dieser ID."

#. type: #sec-references-to-other-components
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**New way (139 classes):** `+@GenerateTargetsFromReferences+` from "
"`+io.openems.core.referencetarget+`. `+target+` contains a placeholder `+$"
"{config.ess_id}+`; a configuration plugin replaces it with the value of the "
"property when loading the configuration. The annotation contains the names "
"of the references (field name or, for setter methods such as `+setModbus+`, "
"the reference name)."
msgstr ""
"**Neuer Weg (139 Klassen):** `+@GenerateTargetsFromReferences+` aus "
"`+io.openems.core.referencetarget+`. In `+target+` steht ein Platzhalter `+$"
"{config.ess_id}+`; ein Configuration-Plugin ersetzt ihn beim Laden der "
"Konfiguration durch den Wert der Property. In der Annotation stehen die "
"Namen der Referenzen (Feldname oder, bei Setter-Methoden wie `+setModbus+`, "
"der Referenzname)."

#. type: #sec-references-to-other-components
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**Old way (still in a few classes):** an additional property `+ess_target+` "
"in the Config and the call `+OpenemsComponent.updateReferenceFilter(cm, "
"servicePid(), \"ess\", config.ess_id())+` in `+activate()+`. This writes the "
"filter to the configuration and triggers a reactivation."
msgstr ""
"**Alter Weg (noch in wenigen Klassen):** eine zusätzliche Property "
"`+ess_target+` in der Config und im `+activate()+` der Aufruf "
"`+OpenemsComponent.updateReferenceFilter(cm, servicePid(), \"ess\", "
"config.ess_id())+`. Das schreibt den Filter in die Konfiguration und löst "
"eine Neuaktivierung aus."

#. type: #sec-references-to-other-components
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid "Options of the reference:"
msgstr "Optionen der Referenz:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option\n"
"| Effect\n"
"\n"
"| `+cardinality = MANDATORY+`\n"
"| Without a matching component, the Controller is not activated.\n"
"| `+cardinality = OPTIONAL+` / `+MULTIPLE+`\n"
"| none or one / any number of components; with `+policy = DYNAMIC+`, the field must be `+volatile+` or a thread-safe list.\n"
"| `+policy = STATIC+`\n"
"| If the reference changes, the component is reactivated. Simple and safe.\n"
"| `+policy = DYNAMIC+`\n"
"| Reference is replaced at runtime, without reactivation.\n"
"| `+policyOption = GREEDY+`\n"
"| immediately binds a better matching component as soon as it appears.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Option\n"
"| Wirkung\n"
"\n"
"| `+cardinality = MANDATORY+`\n"
"| Ohne passende Komponente wird der Controller nicht aktiviert.\n"
"| `+cardinality = OPTIONAL+` / `+MULTIPLE+`\n"
"| keine oder eine / beliebig viele Komponenten; bei `+policy = DYNAMIC+` muss das Feld `+volatile+` bzw. eine thread-sichere Liste sein.\n"
"| `+policy = STATIC+`\n"
"| Ändert sich die Referenz, wird die Komponente neu aktiviert. Einfach und sicher.\n"
"| `+policy = DYNAMIC+`\n"
"| Referenz wird zur Laufzeit ausgetauscht, ohne Neuaktivierung.\n"
"| `+policyOption = GREEDY+`\n"
"| bindet sofort eine besser passende Komponente, sobald sie erscheint.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"The filter `+(enabled=true)+` ensures that disabled components are not bound."
msgstr ""
"Der Filter `+(enabled=true)+` sorgt dafür, dass deaktivierte Komponenten "
"nicht gebunden werden."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Other common building blocks"
msgstr "Weitere übliche Bausteine"

#. type: #sec-other-common-building-blocks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**`+debugLog()+`**: returns a short string that “Controller Debug Log” "
"outputs every second (e.g. `pass:c[\"L:\" + getActivePower().asString()]`)."
msgstr ""
"**`+debugLog()+`**: liefert eine kurze Zeichenkette, die „Controller Debug "
"Log“ jede Sekunde ausgibt (z. B. `pass:c[\"L:\" + "
"getActivePower().asString()]`)."

#. type: #sec-other-common-building-blocks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**`+ModbusSlave+`**: makes Channels readable or writable via the Modbus/TCP "
"API (`+getModbusSlaveTable()+`)."
msgstr ""
"**`+ModbusSlave+`**: macht Channels über die Modbus/TCP-API lesbar oder "
"schreibbar (`+getModbusSlaveTable()+`)."

#. type: #sec-other-common-building-blocks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**`+EventHandler+`**: for work outside `+run()+` in a Cycle Event; the "
"topics are in the `+@Component+` property `+EventConstants.EVENT_TOPIC+`."
msgstr ""
"**`+EventHandler+`**: für Arbeit außerhalb von `+run()+` in einem Zyklus-"
"Ereignis; die Topics stehen in der `+@Component+`-Property "
"`+EventConstants.EVENT_TOPIC+`."

#. type: #sec-other-common-building-blocks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**Clock**: `+componentManager.getClock()+` instead of `+Instant.now()+`; the "
"clock can then be controlled in tests."
msgstr ""
"**Uhr**: `+componentManager.getClock()+` statt `+Instant.now()+`; in Tests "
"lässt sich die Uhr dann steuern."

#. type: #sec-other-common-building-blocks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"**Logging**: `+this.logInfo(log, …)+`, `+logWarn+`, `+logError+` from "
"`+AbstractOpenemsComponent+` prefix the Component-ID."
msgstr ""
"**Logging**: `+this.logInfo(log, …)+`, `+logWarn+`, `+logError+` aus "
"`+AbstractOpenemsComponent+` stellen die Komponenten-ID voran."

#. type: #sec-other-common-building-blocks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid "**`+readme.adoc+`**: is included in this documentation."
msgstr "**`+readme.adoc+`**: wird in die offizielle Dokumentation übernommen."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checklist for a new bundle"
msgstr "Checkliste neues Bundle"

#. type: #sec-checklist-for-a-new-bundle
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"Create the directory `+io.openems.edge.<area>.<name>+` with `+bnd.bnd+`, "
"`+src+`, `+test+`, `+readme.adoc+` (the easiest way is to copy a similar "
"bundle)."
msgstr ""
"Verzeichnis `+io.openems.edge.<bereich>.<name>+` mit `+bnd.bnd+`, `+src+`, "
"`+test+`, `+readme.adoc+` anlegen (am einfachsten ein ähnliches Bundle "
"kopieren)."

#. type: #sec-checklist-for-a-new-bundle
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"Choose a unique Factory-PID in `+@Component(name = …)+`; scheme e.g. "
"`+Controller.Ess.Xyz+`, `+Meter.Manufacturer.Type+`."
msgstr ""
"Factory-PID in `+@Component(name = …)+` eindeutig wählen; Schema z. B. "
"`+Controller.Ess.Xyz+`, `+Meter.Hersteller.Typ+`."

#. type: #sec-checklist-for-a-new-bundle
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"Write a test with `+ComponentTest+`/`+ControllerTest+` (xref:development/"
"testing/component-tests.adoc[Component tests])."
msgstr ""
"Test mit `+ComponentTest+`/`+ControllerTest+` schreiben (xref:development/"
"testing/component-tests.adoc[Tests])."

#. type: #sec-checklist-for-a-new-bundle
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid "Run `+./gradlew :<bundle>:test+` and `+:<bundle>:checkstyleMain+`."
msgstr ""
"`+./gradlew :<bundle>:test+` und `+:<bundle>:checkstyleMain+` ausführen."

#. type: #sec-checklist-for-a-new-bundle
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"Enter the bundle in `+io.openems.edge.application/EdgeApp.bndrun+` under `+-"
"runrequires+` so that it is part of the Edge JAR."
msgstr ""
"Bundle in `+io.openems.edge.application/EdgeApp.bndrun+` unter `+-"
"runrequires+` eintragen, damit es in der Edge-JAR enthalten ist."

#. type: #sec-checklist-for-a-new-bundle
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/controller.adoc
msgid ""
"Follow the xref:development/coding-guidelines.adoc[Coding Guidelines] and "
"run `+./tools/prepare-commit.sh+`."
msgstr ""
"xref:latest@development/coding-guidelines.adoc[Coding Guidelines] beachten "
"und `+./tools/prepare-commit.sh+` ausführen."
